function openKron(){kronCheck(null);KAPMODE='kron';KRONSEL=0;$('title').hidden=true;$('kap').hidden=false;renderKron();setTimeout(()=>{const f=$('kapList').children[0];f&&f.focus()},30)}
function closeKron(){closeKap()}
function hms(t){t=Math.round(t||0);const h=Math.floor(t/3600),m=Math.floor(t%3600/60);return h?h+' h '+m+' min':m+' min'}
function kronRows(){const W=weekNight(),cn={r:HEROES.r.n,k:HEROES.k.n,z:HEROES.z.n,d:HEROES.d.n,m:HEROES.m.n};
  if(KRONTAB===0){const done=META.wk.done===W.key,Dn=dayNight(),dd=META.dy.done===Dn.key;return[{n:EN?'Daily challenge':'Wyzwanie dnia',s:(dd?'✓ ':'')+Dn.ruleN+' · '+cn[Dn.cls],ok:dd,day:Dn},{icon:kronIcon(),n:(EN?'Night of the Week ':'Noc tygodnia ')+W.key,s:(done?'✓ ':'')+(EN?'Act ':'Rozdz. ')+['I','II','III','IV','V'][W.ch-1]+' · '+cn[W.cls]+' · '+W.curseN,ok:done,week:W}]}
  if(KRONTAB===1)return KRON.map(([id,n,d,ash])=>({icon:kronIcon(),id,n,s:(META.kr[id]?'✓ ':'')+ash+(EN?' Ashes':' Popiołów'),ok:!!META.kr[id],d,ash}));
  if(KRONTAB===2)return [...'rkzdm'].map(c=>({img:PREMIUM_ASSETS['portret-'+HEROES[c].art]||'',n:cn[c],s:(EN?'Medals ':'Medale ')+[1,2,3,4,5].filter(ch=>medalOf(c,ch)).length+'/5 · '+(EN?'gold ':'złote ')+[1,2,3,4,5].filter(ch=>medalOf(c,ch)>=3).length+'/5',ok:true,cls:c}));
  if(KRONTAB===5){const nt=META.notes||{},R=['I','II','III','IV','V'];return NOTE_ALL.map(n=>({n:nt[n.id]?n.t:'???',s:(EN?'Act ':'Rozdział ')+R[n.ch-1]+(nt[n.id]?'':(EN?' · not found yet':' · jeszcze nie znaleziona')),ok:!!nt[n.id],note:n}))}
  if(KRONTAB===4){const st=META.st,cl=[...'rkzdm'],fav=c=>{const e=Object.entries(META.sku).filter(([k])=>k[0]===c).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1])[0];return e&&SK[e[0].slice(2)]?SK[e[0].slice(2)].name:'—'};
    return [{n:EN?'Overall':'Ogółem',s:(EN?'nights ':'noce ')+st.nights+' · '+(EN?'won ':'wygrane ')+st.wins+' · '+hms(st.time),ok:true,stat:'all'},
      ...cl.map(c=>({img:PREMIUM_ASSETS['portret-'+HEROES[c].art]||'',n:cn[c],s:(EN?'nights ':'noce ')+Math.max(st['n'+c.toUpperCase()],st[{r:'winR',k:'winK',z:'winZ',d:'winD',m:'winM'}[c]])+' · '+(EN?'won ':'wygrane ')+st[{r:'winR',k:'winK',z:'winZ',d:'winD',m:'winM'}[c]]+' · '+fav(c),ok:true,stat:c})),
      {n:EN?'Records by act':'Rekordy rozdziałów',s:(EN?'kills, streak, strongest blow':'zabici, seria, najmocniejszy cios'),ok:true,stat:'rec'}]}
  return Object.keys(ENAME).filter(t=>t!=='glizzard').sort((a,b)=>(META.kills[b]||0)-(META.kills[a]||0)).map(t=>{const n=META.kills[t]||0;return{img:n?beastImg(t,64):'',n:n?ENAME[t]:'???',s:n?(EN?'killed ':'zabici ')+n+(n>=50?' ✓':' / 50'):(EN?'not met yet':'jeszcze nie spotkany'),ok:n>0,beast:t,kills:n}}).concat(NAMED_ALL.map(r=>({r,n:META.nm[r.id]||0})).sort((a,b)=>(b.n?1:0)-(a.n?1:0)||a.r.ch-b.r.ch).map(({r,n})=>({img:n?namedImg(r.type,64):'',n:n?'★ '+r.n:'★ ???',s:n?(EN?'named elite · defeated ':'elita z imieniem · pokonana ')+n:(EN?'named elite · act ':'elita z imieniem · rozdz. ')+['I','II','III','IV','V'][r.ch-1],ok:n>0,named:r,beast:r.type,kills:n})))}
function renderKron(){$('kapH').textContent=EN?'Chronicle':'Kronika';$('kapE').textContent=EMB.e;
  const T=kapTabsEl();T.innerHTML='';[EN?'Special Nights':'Noce specjalne',EN?'Achievements':'Osiągnięcia',EN?'Medals':'Medale',EN?'Bestiary':'Bestiariusz',EN?'Statistics':'Statystyki',EN?'Notes':'Zapiski'].forEach((nm,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.className='tab'+(i===KRONTAB?' on':'');b.setAttribute('role','tab');b.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(i===KRONTAB));b.textContent=(i+1)+'. '+nm;b.dataset.kt=i;b.addEventListener('click',()=>kapSetTab(i));T.appendChild(b)});
  const st=document.createElement('span');st.className='m2k-tier';st.textContent=(EN?'Achievements ':'Osiągnięcia ')+KRON.filter(k=>META.kr[k[0]]).length+'/'+KRON.length+(EN?' · medals ':' · medale ')+Object.values(META.med).filter(v=>v>0).length+'/45';if(KRONTAB===3){const all=Object.keys(ENAME).filter(t=>t!=='glizzard'),seen=all.filter(t=>META.kills[t]).length;st.textContent=(EN?'Discovered ':'Odkryto ')+seen+'/'+all.length+' · ★ '+NAMED_ALL.filter(r=>META.nm[r.id]).length+'/'+NAMED_ALL.length}if(KRONTAB===5)st.textContent=(EN?'Notes found ':'Znalezione zapiski ')+NOTE_ALL.filter(n=>(META.notes||{})[n.id]).length+'/'+NOTE_ALL.length;T.appendChild(st);
  const R=kronRows();if(KRONSEL>=R.length)KRONSEL=0;const L=$('kapList');L.innerHTML='';
  kronNewCss();const nkey=r=>!r||!r.ok?null:KRONTAB===1?'a:'+r.id:KRONTAB===3?(r.named?'e:'+r.named.id:'b:'+r.beast):KRONTAB===5?'n:'+r.note.id:null;kronNew();
  {const k=nkey(R[KRONSEL]);if(k&&!META.sn[k]){META.sn[k]=1;saveMeta()}}
  const NW=new Set(kronNew()),NT={a:1,b:3,e:3,n:5};{const has={};for(const k of NW)has[NT[k[0]]]=1;for(const tb of T.querySelectorAll('button[data-kt]'))if(has[tb.dataset.kt]){const d=document.createElement('i');d.className='nbk-dot';d.title=EN?'New entries':'Nowe wpisy';tb.appendChild(d)}}
  R.forEach((r,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.className='m2k-row'+(i===KRONSEL?' on':'')+(r.ok?'':' lk');b.innerHTML=`<b>${r.n}${NW.has(nkey(r))?'<em class="nbk-new">'+(EN?'NEW':'NOWE')+'</em>':''}</b><span class="m2k-pips"></span><small>${r.s}</small>`;
    if(r.img){const art=document.createElement('img');art.className='premium-shrine-icon';art.alt='';art.src=r.img;if(KRONTAB===2||KRONTAB===4)art.style.objectFit='cover';b.prepend(art)}else b.style.setProperty('padding-left','18px','important');
    // Presentation only: sizes and alignment are owned by nbUiSystem.
    b.classList.add('nbui-kron-row');b.classList.toggle('nbui-has-art',!!r.img);
    {const pp=b.querySelector('.m2k-pips');if(pp)pp.remove()}
    b.addEventListener('click',()=>{KRONSEL=i;renderKron();const nb=$('kapList').children[i];nb&&nb.focus()});L.appendChild(b)});
  const r=R[KRONSEL],D=$('kapDet'),cn0={r:HEROES.r.n,k:HEROES.k.n,z:HEROES.z.n,d:HEROES.d.n,m:HEROES.m.n};let body='',btn='';
  if(KRONTAB===0&&r.day){const Dn=r.day,y=META.dy,best=y.key===Dn.key?y.best:0,yd=new Date();yd.setDate(yd.getDate()-1);const streak=y.done===Dn.key||y.done===dayKey(yd)?y.streak:0;
    body=`<p>${EN?'Rule of the day':'Zasada dnia'}: <b>${Dn.ruleN}</b><br><small>${Dn.ruleD}</small></p>
      <p>${EN?'Act':'Rozdział'}: <b>${['I','II','III','IV','V'][Dn.ch-1]} · ${CHN[Dn.ch-1]}</b> · ${EN?'Character':'Postać'}: <b>${cn0[Dn.cls]}</b></p>
      <p>${EN?'Reward':'Nagroda'}: <b>${DAILY_ASH} ${EN?'Ashes':'Popiołów'}</b> <small>(${EN?'once a day':'raz dziennie'})</small></p>
      <p>${EN?'Streak':'Seria'}: <b>${streak}</b> · ${EN?'best':'najlepsza'}: <b>${y.top}</b></p>
      <p>${r.ok?(EN?'✓ Won today.':'✓ Wygrane dzisiaj.'):''}${best?' '+(EN?'Best kills: ':'Najwięcej zabitych: ')+best:''}</p>`;
    btn=`<button type="button" class="m2-b m2k-buy" id="kronDay">${EN?'PLAY THE DAILY CHALLENGE':'GRAJ WYZWANIE DNIA'}</button>`}
  else if(KRONTAB===0){const W=r.week,ch=CHALS.find(c=>c.id===W.chal),cu=CURSES.find(c=>c.id===W.curse),best=META.wk.key===W.key?META.wk.best:0;
    body=`<p>${EN?'Act':'Rozdział'}: <b>${['I','II','III','IV','V'][W.ch-1]} · ${CHN[W.ch-1]}</b> · ${EN?'Character':'Postać'}: <b>${cn0[W.cls]}</b></p>
      <p>${EN?'Challenge':'Wyzwanie'}: <b>${ch?ch.n:'—'}</b>${ch?'<br><small>'+ch.d+'</small>':''}</p><p>${EN?'Curse':'Klątwa'}: <b>${cu.n}</b><br><small>${cu.d}</small></p><p>${EN?'Reward':'Nagroda'}: <b>60 ${EN?'Ashes':'Popiołów'}</b> <small>(${EN?'once a week, +25% for the curse':'raz w tygodniu, +25% za klątwę'})</small></p>
      <p>${r.ok?(EN?'✓ Won this week.':'✓ Wygrana w tym tygodniu.'):''}${best?' '+(EN?'Best kills: ':'Najwięcej zabitych: ')+best:''}</p>`;
    btn=`<button type="button" class="m2-b m2k-buy" id="kronGo">${EN?'PLAY THE NIGHT OF THE WEEK':'GRAJ NOC TYGODNIA'}</button>`}
  else if(KRONTAB===1)body=`<p class="m2k-d">${r.d}</p><p>${EN?'Reward':'Nagroda'}: <b>${r.ash} ${EN?'Ashes':'Popiołów'}</b></p><p><b>${r.ok?(EN?'✓ Earned':'✓ Zdobyte'):(EN?'Not earned yet':'Jeszcze nie zdobyte')}</b></p>`;
  else if(KRONTAB===2){const row=[1,2,3,4,5].map(ch=>{const v=medalOf(r.cls,ch);return `<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6em;margin:.35em 0"><i style="flex:none;display:inline-block;width:1.1em;height:1.1em;border-radius:50%;background:${v?MEDAL_C[v]:'rgba(255,255,255,.1)'};box-shadow:${v?'0 0 6px '+MEDAL_C[v]:'none'}"></i><span>${['I','II','III','IV','V'][ch-1]} · ${CHN[ch-1]}: <b>${v?MEDAL_N[v]:'—'}</b></span></div>`}).join('');
    body=`<div style="text-align:left;display:inline-block">${row}</div><p class="m2k-d">${EN?'Bronze: survive the night. Silver: survive and complete the challenge. Gold: also at most 10 hits taken and not on Easy. First medal of each kind: 20 / 40 / 80 Ashes.':'Brąz: przetrwaj noc. Srebro: przetrwaj i ukończ wyzwanie. Złoto: do tego najwyżej 10 trafień i nie na Łatwym. Pierwszy medal danego rodzaju: 20 / 40 / 80 Popiołów.'}</p>`}
  else if(KRONTAB===5){const n=r.note,R=['I','II','III','IV','V'];body=r.ok?`<p class="m2k-d nbk-lore nbk-note">${n.d}</p>`:`<p class="m2k-d">${EN?'A note from act '+R[n.ch-1]+'. One unfound note appears each night, lying near a campfire or a shrine: look for a faint golden glow.':'Zapiska z rozdziału '+R[n.ch-1]+'. Każdej nocy pojawia się jedna nieznaleziona zapiska, leży przy ognisku albo kapliczce: szukaj słabego, złotego blasku.'}</p>`}
  else if(KRONTAB===4){const st=META.st,f=v=>Number(v||0).toLocaleString(EN?'en-US':'pl-PL'),tr=(a,b)=>`<tr><td>${a}</td><td><b>${b}</b></td></tr>`,tb=x=>`<table class="nbk-st">${x}</table>`,note=`<p class="m2k-d"><small>${EN?'Play time, nights per character, hits taken, damage and favourite skills are counted from 9 Nov 2026.':'Czas gry, noce każdej postaci, otrzymane trafienia, obrażenia i ulubione umiejętności liczone od 9.11.2026.'}</small></p>`;
    if(r.stat==='all')body=tb(tr(EN?'Play time':'Czas gry',hms(st.time))+tr(EN?'Nights played':'Rozegrane noce',f(st.nights))+tr(EN?'Nights won':'Wygrane noce',f(st.wins)+(st.nights?' ('+Math.round(100*st.wins/st.nights)+'%)':''))+tr(EN?'Enemies killed':'Zabici wrogowie',f(st.kills))+tr(EN?'Average per night':'Średnio na noc',f(st.nights?Math.round(st.kills/st.nights):0))+tr(EN?'Damage dealt':'Zadane obrażenia',f(st.dmg))+tr(EN?'Hits taken':'Otrzymane trafienia',f(st.hits))+tr(EN?'Parries':'Parowania',f(st.parries))+tr(EN?'Challenges completed':'Ukończone wyzwania',f(st.chals))+tr(EN?'Named elites':'Elity z imieniem',NAMED_ALL.filter(q=>META.nm[q.id]).length+'/'+NAMED_ALL.length)+tr(EN?'Ashes gathered':'Zebrane Popioły',f(st.ash)))+note;
    else if(r.stat==='rec'){const nm=['I','II','III','IV','V'];body=`<table class="nbk-st nbk-st4"><tr><th></th><th>${EN?'Kills':'Zabici'}</th><th>${EN?'Streak':'Seria'}</th><th>${EN?'Blow':'Cios'}</th><th>${EN?'Endless':'Bez końca'}</th></tr>${[1,2,3,4,5].map(ch=>{const b=(META.bst||{})[ch]||{};return `<tr><td>${nm[ch-1]}</td><td><b>${b.kills?f(b.kills):'—'}</b></td><td><b>${b.streak?f(b.streak):'—'}</b></td><td><b>${b.hit?f(b.hit):'—'}</b></td><td><b>${META.endl[ch]?Math.floor(META.endl[ch]/60)+':'+String(META.endl[ch]%60).padStart(2,'0'):'—'}</b></td></tr>`}).join('')}</table>`}
    else{const c=r.stat,C1=c.toUpperCase(),top=Object.entries(META.sku).filter(([k])=>k[0]===c&&SK[k.slice(2)]).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]).slice(0,5);
      body=tb(tr(EN?'Nights played':'Rozegrane noce',f(Math.max(st['n'+C1],st[{r:'winR',k:'winK',z:'winZ',d:'winD',m:'winM'}[c]])))+tr(EN?'Nights won':'Wygrane noce',f(st[{r:'winR',k:'winK',z:'winZ',d:'winD',m:'winM'}[c]]))+tr(EN?'Play time':'Czas gry',hms(st['t'+C1]))+tr(EN?'Medals':'Medale',[1,2,3,4,5].filter(ch=>medalOf(c,ch)).length+'/5'))+`<p class="m2k-d"><b>${EN?'Favourite skills':'Ulubione umiejętności'}</b><br>${top.length?top.map(([k,n])=>SK[k.slice(2)].name+' <small>×'+n+'</small>').join('<br>'):(EN?'No data yet.':'Jeszcze brak danych.')}</p>`+note}}
  else if(r.named){const q=r.named;body=r.kills?`<p class="m2k-d nbk-lore">${q.d}</p><p class="m2k-d">${EN?'Defeated':'Pokonana'}: <b>${r.kills}</b> · ${ENAME[q.type]}</p><p>${EN?'✓ First defeat: +'+NAMED_ASH+' Ashes earned':'✓ Pierwsze pokonanie: zdobyto '+NAMED_ASH+' Popiołów'}</p>`:`<p class="m2k-d">${EN?'A named elite of act '+['I','II','III','IV','V'][q.ch-1]+'. Sometimes an elite steps out of the dark with a name of its own: defeat it to learn its story.':'Elita z imieniem z rozdziału '+['I','II','III','IV','V'][q.ch-1]+'. Czasem z mroku wychodzi elita z własnym imieniem: pokonaj ją, by poznać jej historię.'}</p><p>${EN?'First defeat':'Pierwsze pokonanie'}: <b>+${NAMED_ASH} ${EN?'Ashes':'Popiołów'}</b></p>`}
  else body=r.kills?`${BEAST_D[r.beast]?'<p class="m2k-d nbk-lore">'+BEAST_D[r.beast]+'</p>':''}<p class="m2k-d">${EN?'Killed so far':'Zabici do tej pory'}: <b>${r.kills}</b></p><p>${r.kills>=50?(EN?'✓ 50 killed: +10 Ashes earned':'✓ 50 zabitych: zdobyto 10 Popiołów'):(EN?'At 50 killed: +10 Ashes':'Przy 50 zabitych: +10 Popiołów')+' ('+r.kills+'/50)'}</p>`:`<p class="m2k-d">${EN?'You have not met this creature yet. Discover enemies on your journeys: each first kill adds a card here.':'Tej istoty jeszcze nie spotkałeś. Odkrywaj przeciwników podczas wypraw: każde pierwsze zabójstwo dodaje tu kartę.'}</p>`;
  // 8.11.2026 (UI audit D): action pinned to the bottom of the panel, only the description scrolls
  D.innerHTML=`<div class="nbk-scroll"><div class="m2k-head" id="kapHd"></div>${body}</div>${btn}`;$('kapHd').textContent=r.n;
  // Chronicle scrolling, type and action placement are owned by nbUiSystem.
  const bigSrc=KRONTAB===4&&r.img?r.img:KRONTAB===3&&r.kills?(r.named?namedImg:beastImg)(r.beast,192):KRONTAB===2?r.img:KRONTAB===1?kronIcon():'';if(bigSrc){const big=document.createElement('img');big.className='premium-shrine-detail';big.alt='';big.src=bigSrc;if(KRONTAB===2||KRONTAB===4)big.style.objectFit='cover';D.querySelector('.nbk-scroll').prepend(big)}
  const go=$('kronGo');if(go)go.addEventListener('click',()=>{KAPMODE='kap';$('kap').hidden=true;startWeekly()});
  const gd=$('kronDay');if(gd)gd.addEventListener('click',()=>{KAPMODE='kap';$('kap').hidden=true;startDaily()})}

